{"title":"Career roadmap · Editor","role":"Editor","summary":"An Editor reviews, improves and prepares written content for publication by checking language, grammar, structure, accuracy, consistency, tone and readability. A BA in Hindi or a regional language provides a strong foundation for language-specific publishing, journalism, education, media, translation and digital content.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Hindi / Regional Languages"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Strong direct alignment. Entry-level editorial roles are accessible after graduation, while senior editorial positions generally require substantial publishing experience and subject expertise."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Hindi/Regional Language","Editorial/Publishing Internship","Editorial Assistant","Junior Editor","Editor","Senior Editor","Managing Editor","Editorial Director / Language Editor-in-Chief"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Master grammar, editing, literature, research, publishing workflows and digital-content tools."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in publishing, journalism, education, translation, digital media or a specific language/domain."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Editor, Managing Editor, Language Editor or Editorial Lead."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead publishing operations, multilingual editorial teams or build an independent editorial/translation practice."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Grammar, vocabulary and literary analysis"},{"text":"Language/literature cour